OL,3,GNEWSAStabbed man named after second
OL,4,Amurder arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have made a second arrest while
OL,7,Finvestigating the death of a man who
OL,8,Fwas stabbed to death in a city park.
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police said Zherko
OL,11,FRasul Osman, 24, suffered serious stab
OL,12,Fwounds on Chapel Street, Levenshulme,
OL,13,Fat 19:06 BST on Saturday, and died at
OL,14,Fthe scene.
OL,16,FOn Tuesday, a 23-year-old man was
OL,17,Farrested on suspicion of murder and
OL,18,Fremains in custody, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
