OL,3,GNEWSAStabbed man named after second
OL,4,Amurder arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt added that a 27-year-old man who had
OL,7,Falso been arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fmurder has been released on bail
OL,9,Fpending further enquiries.
